 $D7CD DEFB $FF,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00 ; tile 5 (conveyor): bright white on white, flashing [not used in this room]
; Conveyor: direction, address of the leftmost cell in the attribute buffer, length in cells.
 $D7D6 DEFB $00,$00,$00,$00 ; no conveyor (length 0)
; Ramp: direction, attribute buffer address of its lowest cell, length in cells.
 $D7DA DEFB $01,$D6,$5F,$07 ; direction 1 (rises to the right), lowest cell $5FD6 = row 14 column 22, 7 cells
